 Share to social with the hashtag #apiratecaptain and #pirateslife Check your list to see how successful you were at hunting down crew and supplies. You can play again to try and improve your score! Yo ho!","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":43.552,"end":61.024,"frac":0.957,"status":"ok","matched":45,"words":47},"large":{"start":43.552,"end":61.024,"frac":0.979,"status":"ok","matched":46,"words":47},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"There are 4 different endings and 12 different combinations of crew and supplies you could collect. Can you complete all the pathways?","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":22},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":22},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68fbfc1f433da_PC%20JM12_solo_skeleton_no_shadow.png"}